# Q: the heights hold the ford — can the mission be lost through it?
#
#   MiVic.Game.exe --mission b3_seelow --probe tools/probe/b3-seelow.probe --probe-out artifacts/probe/b3-seelow.txt
#
# The denial is the primary objective, and it can only fail one way: four of theirs through
# the gap. The probe walks them there itself, because a denial that cannot fail is not one.

objectives
units western 6
tick 200
order 30 move -270 -270
order 31 move -270 -270
order 32 move -270 -270
order 33 move -270 -270
tick 12000
objectives
